# Exchange Password

macOS app that stores a new password on the Exchange account Mail already has.

- `Sources/ExchangePasswordApp.swift` — window for choosing the account and entering the password
- `Sources/ExchangeAccount.swift` — reads Exchange accounts from Mail
- `Sources/MailPassword.swift` — closes Mail’s stuck password dialog and sets the password through Mail
- `Info.plist` — bundle id `local.exchange-password`
- `build.sh` — builds `build/Exchange Password.app`
- `README.md` — what the app does and how to run it
- `screenshot.png` — window picture with a sample account
- `LICENSE` — MIT, Copyright © 2026 Peter Adrianov
